{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization","doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials","doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Decimal","doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Decimal\/FormatStyle"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"attributed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials7DecimalV","text":"Decimal"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Decimal\/FormatStyle","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials7DecimalV0A20InternationalizationE11FormatStyleV","text":"FormatStyle"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Decimal\/FormatStyle\/Attributed-swift.struct","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials7DecimalV0A20InternationalizationE11FormatStyleV10AttributedV","text":"Attributed"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this modifier to create a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Decimal\/FormatStyle\/Attributed-swift.struct","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instance, which formats"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AttributedString"},{"type":"text","text":" instances. These attributed strings contain attributes from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AttributeScopes\/FoundationAttributes\/NumberFormatAttributes"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute scope. Use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"these attributes to determine which runs of the attributed string represent different"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parts of the formatted value."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example finds runs of the attributed string that represent different parts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of a formatted currency, and adds additional attributes like"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AttributeScopes\/SwiftUIAttributes\/foregroundColor"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AttributeScopes\/FoundationAttributes\/inlinePresentationIntent"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["func attributedPrice(price: Decimal) -> AttributedString {","    var attributedPrice = price.formatted(","        .currency(code: \"USD\")","        .attributed)","","    for run in attributedPrice.runs {","        if run.attributes.numberSymbol == .currency ||","            run.attributes.numberSymbol == .decimalSeparator {","            attributedPrice[run.range].foregroundColor = .red","        }","        if run.attributes.numberPart == .integer ||","            run.attributes.numberPart == .fraction {","            attributedPrice[run.range].inlinePresentationIntent = [.stronglyEmphasized]","        }","    }","    return attributedPrice","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"User interface frameworks like SwiftUI can use these attributes when presenting the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attributed string."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Decimal\/FormatStyle\/attributed-swift.property"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/foundationinternationalization\/foundationessentials\/decimal\/formatstyle\/attributed-swift.property"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An attributed format style based on the decimal format style."}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"FoundationInternationalization"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:20FoundationEssentials7DecimalV0A20InternationalizationE11FormatStyleV10attributedAF10AttributedVvp","title":"attributed","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"attributed","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials7DecimalV","text":"Decimal","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials7DecimalV0A20InternationalizationE11FormatStyleV","text":"FormatStyle","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials7DecimalV0A20InternationalizationE11FormatStyleV10AttributedV","text":"Attributed","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"15.0"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"15.0"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"12.0"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":